      "text": "Search this site Embedded Files DigiHealth Lab - UCSD Members Edward Jay Wang (PI) Edward Wang leads the DigiHealth Lab at UC San Diego's Design Lab and ECE department since 2019. His research focuses on developing new sensing techniques necessary for enabling precise and personalized medicine. His passions include bridging the gap between the medical community and technology researchers to develop meaningful technology that truly impacts the face of medical diagnosis and treatment. Current PhD Students Yujia (Nancy ) Liu Medical Device Systems PhD Student Ava Fascetti Medical Device Systems PhD Student Pamely Zantou Machine Learning Data Science PhD Student Former PhD Students Dr. Colin Barry Visiting Assistant Professor at Harvey Mudd College PhD, 2026 Dr. Tom (Yinan) Xuan LLM Agent Architect at Pairwise (deployed at Meta) PhD, 2025 Dr. Jessica de Souza Postdoc at Duke University PhD, 2025 Dr. Varun Viswanath Algorithm Scientist at Oura PhD, 2024 Former Students and Visiting Scholars Su-Jin Koh, MD, PhD (Visiting Scholar), 2025-2026 Juo-Hsuan (Nana) Chang (MS), 2024-2026 Sophia Yu (MS), 2025-2026 Anusha Rao, 2024-2026 Tanish Talapaneni ( MS ), 2025 Greta Danae Daniells Suárez (ENLACE program), 2025 Daniela Merari Franco García (ENLACE program), 2025 Jack Shi, 2025 Jade Chng, 2024 - 2025 Anupama Nambiar, 2024 - 2025 Shruti Bhamidipati, 2024 - 2025 Ariana Talai, 2024 - 2025 Tanya Punater, 2024 - 2025 Ana Matte, 2024 - 2025 Hongyue \"Grace\" Jin ( MS ), 2022 - 2024 Minjae Kim, 2024 Yann Baglin Bunod, 2024 Jerry Ding ( MS ), 2024 Hugo Adalberto Silva Contreras (ENLACE program), 2024 Marlene Beltran Flores (ENLACE program), 2024 Aatash Pestonjamasp, 2023 - 2024 Gi Won Choi , MD, PhD (Visiting Scholar), 2023-2024 Alison Nguyen (GEAR program), 2023 - 2024 Foster Dang (GEAR program), 2023 - 2024 Celine Nguyen (MADURA program), 2023 - 2024 Sabrina Cheng, 2023 - 2024 Xuanxi Du ( MS ), 2023 Yu Fu, 2023 JD Lee, 2023 Ruben Dario Romero Perex (ENLACE program), 20